    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You trained all your life to join the Shadowmasters, the secretive thieves' guild that rules the realm of Thesk from the shadows. Stealth and quick reflexes were only the beginning of your education; you also had to sharpen your ruthlessness to keep the guild's secrets safe. But a single misstep got you expelled from the order, and now you must find your own way.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.feats24.Item.phbftSavageAttac]{Savage Attacker}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Acrobatics and Stealth</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulThievesToo]{Thieves' Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Daggers}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulThievesToo]{Thieves' Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCaltrops000]{Caltrops}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCostume0000]{Costume}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagGrapplingHo]{Grappling Hook}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagSpikesIron0]{Iron Spikes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagMirror00000]{Mirror}, 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 3 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
